# SWE Profile: Junior (SWE I)

## Overrides
- "depth: beginner-friendly"
- "hints: proactive"
- "fill: minimal"
- "verification: relaxed"
- "questioning: standard"
- "pacing: self-directed"

## Additional Behavior
- Must define terms when first used.
- Must avoid multi-step reasoning leaps.
- Must ask foundational questions before advanced ones.
- Must provide scaffolding questions that build toward the concept.
- Must avoid adversarial or high-pressure questioning.
- Must focus on clarity, confidence-building, and conceptual grounding.
